Hi,



Please follow the steps below and proceed accordingly based on which steps are applicable to you for sodexo card



1.      Your amount is exceeding 10k and you have done minimum kyc while activating the card.
Kindly do the full kyc to receive the amount...!!

https://kyc.sodexobrs.com



2.      If your Sodexo card was not active for more than 6 months, the amount in the card was moved to dormant account. As you have recently activated the card , basis the trail mail ,we have forwarded your request to the concerned team to transfer the loads from dormant account back into your card .The pending loads shall be credited into your card within 5-7 working days.   Card activation -  https://activation.consumers.pluxee.in



3.     Here is a link https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xEo1f9YWZ6Q<https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=xEo1f9YWZ6Q__;!!F1ew_n7Lmw!kY6rWPbIf7ndiGgquYOBcZUdpx8nBlV0a-4cOBrNSFHri9kJl1Jkce5gdJ6ioCU83VU_JyWaeIfv6ureko9H8-pu$> to a video that explains how to activate your card. Kindly follow the steps demonstrated in the video to activate your card with Minimum KYC.

4.      Every month the food allowance amount is crediting in sodexo card the renewal card will get to Company address and we will hand over to employee



5.      If Every month the food allowance amount is not crediting. The exipry card employee must get through customer. The details are below

User needs to replace it via mobile app or need to reach out to customer care for new card.

022 - 6919 6919 / 022 - 4919 6919



6.      Forwarded your request to the concerned team (adithya.bontha@pluxeegroup.com<mailto:adithya.bontha@pluxeegroup.com>) to transfer the loads from dormant account back into your card .

The pending loads shall be credited into your card within 5-7 working days



Thanks & Regards

